{%- comment -%}
  First Access — the campaign landing page.

  A .liquid template rather than .json because only a .liquid template can
  choose its layout, and this page's defining property is that it does NOT
  render the store chrome. `layout/first-access.liquid` is theme.liquid with
  the header, footer and cart drawer removed.

  NAMED -campaign because Shopify refuses two templates with the same name and
  different extensions, and the earlier page.first-access.json still exists on
  the theme. The page URL is unchanged — the handle is what a visitor sees.

  A .liquid template carries no section settings of its own, so the hero
  images are named here. They are the launch campaign's own pair, not the
  homepage's: the same ivory-travertine language, but leading with loose
  unset diamonds, which is what this campaign is about and what the homepage
  set does not show.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% layout 'first-access' %}

{% section 'first-access' %}
